{
  "name": "Deadly Whispers",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have learned to lace your mind-affecting magic and weapons with deadly psychic energy.</p><p>When you deal psychic damage to a creature with a spell or hit it with a weapon attack, you can expend one use of your Bardic Inspiration to deal an extra 2d6 psychic damage to that target. You can do so only once per turn.</p><p>The psychic damage increases when you reach certain levels in this class, increasing to 3d6 at 5th level, 5d6 at 10th level, and 8d6 at 15th level.</p>",
